{"version":"v1.88.0","sha256":"09ed5ddb38f44e2bf917b5e5f2a15b243134fa3f5542e9090d2a5ba2c9416731","builder":"465705f3ab07e15204d23c7e4ceb7325e60e1107e71c928c0dbba873ad559c00","shim":"// Stand-in for the `fs-xattr` package inside the bundled Storage API (supabase/storage). Its file
